# LIMPET: the demo player's honey run: every jar in the 23 decks (each taken
# and carried out alive), the Dreadnought's 24th, then the bridge of honey to
# the secret deck, the Comb, and the Alien with its own ending.
game limpet
wait 5
cheat botplan 1
botuntil state == 2 600
botuntil turncoat == 1 80000
botuntil dread == 1 120000
expect honey == 23
botuntil honey == 24 4000
botuntil secret == 1 40000
expect goals == 7
expect cleared == 26
expect secret == 1
expect cleared_bits == 134217727
expect best26 > 3000
botuntil state == 7 4000
botuntil state == 2 4000
expect ends == 3
